2. a traceable evidence representation over claim, source, time, scope, and support, with deterministic conflict-aware gate rules;

3. a reproducible evaluation across a controlled cable case, fixed public real-robot visual and telemetry splits, and a calibrated signal-level corroboration simulation; and

4. an explicit portability contract between an offline backend and a CockroachDB plus Amazon Bedrock adapter, without making cloud services part of the algorithmic claim.
